Section: Lookup

 By pose index, which is what cat-state returns. An index outside the
 flipbook draws nothing.

  cat-polys-for : Integer -> List StillPoly
  cat-polys-for (i) =
    if i == 0 then pose-rest-polys
    else if i == 1 then pose-stride-polys
    else if i == 2 then pose-frozen-polys
    else if i == 3 then pose-coil-polys
    else if i == 4 then pose-flight-polys
    else if i == 5 then pose-land-polys
    else if i == 6 then pose-collapse-polys
    else []
